OL,3,AHow Dolly Parton's business savvy
OL,4,Ahelped her succeed far beyond the
OL,5,Acharts
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut she wasn't crying in 1992 when
OL,8,FWhitney Houston's power-ballad cover
OL,9,Fbecame a hit. Global sales of the song
OL,10,Ftopped 20 million, earning Parton more
OL,11,Fthan $10m in royalties, according to
OL,12,Fbusiness magazine Forbes.
